WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.910
Finally, let's put your website online, for free.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:08.965
Name your home page index dot html, and use simple lowercase file names.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:12.927
Compress your images, so pages load fast on mobile data.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:17.501
Upload your files to a free host, like GitHub Pages or Netlify.

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:21.850
Test the link on a phone, then share it, and ask for feedback.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:32.197
Before you move on, check: Name the home page index.html. Compress your images. Publish on a free host. Submit your live link.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:37.478
Well done. You have finished the course. Now publish your own website.
